    {"fact": "The council's 2026-27 calendar names Monday 12 April 2027 and Monday 7 June 2027 as teacher training days when schools are closed, so pupils return on the Tuesday after the Easter and May breaks.", "source": "https://www.centralbedfordshire.gov.uk/schools-and-education/school-term-and-holiday-dates-central-bedfordshire"},
    {"fact": "The council calls the 2027 Easter break a half-term, from Tuesday 30 March to Friday 9 April 2027, after the Good Friday and Easter Monday bank holidays.", "source": "https://www.centralbedfordshire.gov.uk/schools-and-education/school-term-and-holiday-dates-central-bedfordshire"},
    {"fact": "The council lists each bank holiday that closes schools, such as the early May bank holiday on Monday 3 May 2027 and the spring bank holiday on Monday 31 May 2027.", "source": "https://www.centralbedfordshire.gov.uk/schools-and-education/school-term-and-holiday-dates-central-bedfordshire"},
    {"fact": "Schools can choose when the required 5 training days take place, so parents should check with their school.", "source": "https://www.centralbedfordshire.gov.uk/schools-and-education/school-term-and-holiday-dates-central-bedfordshire"},
